<title>EGYPT: EGYPT'S MIBANK Q1 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>EGYPT'S MIBANK Q1 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the end of the first quarter of calendar 1997, the bank's financial year, and profits for that quarter.</p>
<p>All figures are in Egyptian pounds.</p>
<p>				 Q1 1997		     Q1 1996</p>
<p> Total assets	   9,140,202,668	     8,789,737,735</p>
<p> Customer deposits    6,143,167,201	     6,288,341,977</p>
<p> Provisions		 627,247,186		 583,800,165</p>
<p> Reserves		   359,196,121		 338,187,300</p>
<p> Shareholders funds     462,537,779		 390,635,961</p>
<p> Distributable profits   38,249,033		  29,242,213</p>
<p>(Full name is Misr International Bank/MIBANK )</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
